   "source": [
    "# AI & Machine Learning: Code, Train & Deploy\n",
    "## Week 12 — Project 3: Music Recommendation Ranking Prototype\n",
    "\n",
    "**Syllabus focus:** Project 3 — machine learning modeling and evaluation; feature engineering; model selection; deployment.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Business context:** With cleaned data and models in place, the platform can begin building a recommendation ranking system that surfaces relevant music while also honoring long-tail discovery.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Capstone deliverable:** A recommendation ranking prototype for the final platform concept.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Learning objectives\n",
    "- create a recommendation score\n",
    "- rank candidate artists or tracks\n",
    "- incorporate fairness adjustment\n",
    "- explain why ranking is not the same as sorting by popularity\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "artists = [\n",
    "    {'artist': 'Nova Vela', 'listener_score': 0.95, 'fairness_bonus': 0.03, 'genre_fit': 0.90},\n",
    "    {'artist': 'Bright Echo', 'listener_score': 0.92, 'fairness_bonus': 0.01, 'genre_fit': 0.85},\n",
    "    {'artist': 'Aster Vale', 'listener_score': 0.68, 'fairness_bonus': 0.25, 'genre_fit': 0.80},\n",
    "    {'artist': 'Velvet Foundry', 'listener_score': 0.61, 'fairness_bonus': 0.30, 'genre_fit': 0.72}\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "for artist in artists:\n",
    "    score = 0.5 * artist['listener_score'] + 0.3 * artist['genre_fit'] + 0.2 * artist['fairness_bonus']\n",
    "    artist['final_score'] = round(score, 3)\n",
    "\n",
    "for artist in sorted(artists, key=lambda x: x['final_score'], reverse=True):\n",
    "    print(artist['artist'], artist['final_score'])\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Fairness-aware recommendation logic\n",
    "\n",
    "A purely popularity-driven recommender would likely rank the biggest artists first. A fairness-aware recommender increases the ranking of underrepresented or emerging artists when their fit is strong enough.\n"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Practice task\n",
    "Modify the scoring function to reward artists with high `genre_fit` and low representation, then explain how the ranking changes.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
